  },
  "@hivinz_": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "@hivinz_"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A CLI-only Cursor login now gets a ring, and enterprise/team plans read their real usage instead of reporting nothing to meter.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "仅登录 Cursor CLI 也能显示用量环，企业及团队套餐会读取实际用量，不再显示无计量数据。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A Displays picker in Appearance offers the main display or all of them; a second picker pins a single notch to a named screen.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "外观设置新增显示器选项，可选择主显示器或所有显示器，也可将单个用量环固定到指定屏幕。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A brief window right after sleep, where macOS won't allow a keychain prompt yet, was mistaken for being signed out — which erased the reading and left \"waiting for the first reading\" on screen. It now ages the number instead of throwing it away, and picks back up on its own.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Mac 刚从睡眠唤醒时，系统可能暂时不允许钥匙串提示，此前会被误判为退出登录并清空读数。现在会保留旧读数，并自动恢复刷新。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A card is centred on the ring it belongs to, so the first and last providers threw half of it past the end of the panel — and what fell off was the title. The panel now keeps room for it.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "详情卡片以所属用量环为中心，首尾供应商的卡片曾超出面板并截断标题。现在面板会预留足够空间。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A countdown instead of a reset date": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "重置时间支持倒计时"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A crashed or abandoned chat could read as \"still working\" for a day or more. It now notices when the writing has actually stopped.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "崩溃或已放弃的对话可能持续一天以上显示“正在工作”。现在会识别实际写入是否已经停止。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A limit renewing in four weeks said \"Mon\", which read as this Monday. It says \"28 Sep\".": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "四周后重置的限额曾显示为“周一”，容易被误认为本周一。现在会显示具体日期，如“9 月 28 日”。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A months-old duplicate can no longer win": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "不再误用数月前的重复凭据"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A paused limit is shown as paused": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "暂停的限额会明确显示"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A reading under one percent shows a tenth (\"<0.1%\") instead of rounding to nothing.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "低于 1% 的用量会显示小数或“<0.1%”，不再直接取整为零。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A real Codex account went unmetered": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "修复 Codex 账户限额遗漏"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A ring says when it crosses 80% and 100%": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "用量达到 80% 和 100% 时提醒"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A ring survives waking your Mac": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Mac 唤醒后保留用量环"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A stray click no longer pins the notch open": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "误点击不再导致用量环一直展开"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A stuck Claude ring recovers on its own": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Claude 用量环卡住后可自动恢复"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A system notification once per crossing, muted per provider from its own settings row.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "每次跨越阈值发送一次系统通知，可在各供应商的设置行中单独静音。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A system notification the moment a provider's headline limit crosses 80%, and again at 100% — once per crossing, and again only after the window rolls over. Mute one from the bell beside its row in Accounts.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "供应商主要限额达到 80% 和 100% 时分别发送一次系统通知；同一周期不重复提醒。可通过账户列表旁的铃铛单独静音。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A tooltip with something to explain reserved one line for it however much it said.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "此前详情提示无论内容多长都只预留一行，导致说明被截断。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "A way back from a declined keychain prompt": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "拒绝钥匙串授权后可以重试"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "API Key": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "API 密钥"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "API key": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "API 密钥"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Accent color": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "强调色"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Accounts": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "账户"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Active providers appear after your local entries, with the default provider shown when idle. Requires Code Switch R v2.11.16 or later on the same Mac.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "活跃供应商显示在本地条目之后，空闲时显示默认供应商。需要在同一台 Mac 上运行 Code Switch R v2.11.16 或更新版本。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Add accounts with independent credentials, icons, query scripts and refresh settings.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "添加账户，为每个账户独立配置凭据、图标、查询脚本和刷新设置。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Add, reorder and customize providers, with separate credentials and icons for each account.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "添加、排序和自定义供应商，为每个账户分别设置凭据与图标。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Agent": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "代理"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Alert when %@ crosses 80%% and 100%% of a limit.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "当 %@ 的限额达到 80%% 和 100%% 时提醒。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Alerts for %@ are muted. Click to unmute.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "%@ 的提醒已静音。点击取消静音。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "All displays": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "所有显示器"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Always show no longer turns itself off": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "始终显示不再自行关闭"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Antigravity shows its actual quota": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Antigravity 显示实际配额"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Antigravity's real numbers, and a switch that stays off.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Antigravity 使用真实用量，关闭的开关保持关闭。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "App": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "应用"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Appearance's Reset time picker can show \"Resets in 3h 20m\" instead of a date and time.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "外观中的重置时间选项支持显示“3 小时 20 分钟后重置”，也可继续使用日期和时间。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "As many sessions as your screen can hold": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "根据屏幕空间展示会话"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Auto usage": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "自动用量"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Automatic connection recovery": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "自动恢复连接"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Cancel": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "取消"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Chat requests": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "聊天请求"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Choose Edit position from the right-click menu, then drag to any screen edge. Release to save, or press Escape to cancel.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "从右键菜单选择“编辑位置”，然后拖到任意屏幕边缘。松开保存，按 Escape 取消。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Choose a primary metric, refresh intervals and timeout for each query. Failed refreshes keep the last successful reading.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "为每个查询选择主要指标、刷新间隔和超时时间。刷新失败时保留最后一次成功读数。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Choose an accent colour": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "选择强调色"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Choose where Codenotch appears": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "选择 Codenotch 的显示位置"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Claude Code files a new keychain entry on every token rotation. An account signed in for a while could pick an old, expired one at random and show \"waiting for the first reading\" forever.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Claude Code 每次轮换令牌都会新增钥匙串条目。登录较久的账户此前可能随机读到过期条目，一直等待首次读数。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Claude reads its own CLI's /usage first, touching the keychain only as a fallback; Antigravity's language server is asked before it.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Claude 优先读取自身 CLI 的 /usage，仅在必要时回退到钥匙串；Antigravity 优先查询自身语言服务器。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Claude, Cursor, Codex and Gemini": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Claude、Cursor、Codex 和 Gemini"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Clicking near the screen edge before the notch had even opened could leave it stuck open with nothing on screen explaining why.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "用量环尚未展开时点击屏幕边缘，曾可能让它一直展开且没有任何说明。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Clicking the notch toggled the same flag the setting used, so a stray click quietly put it back to showing on hover.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "点击用量环曾修改与设置相同的开关，误点击就会悄悄恢复为悬停显示。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Code Switch R · %@": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Code Switch R · %@"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Codenotch already knows the moment an agent stops working or stops to ask you something. Clicking the notch while it is open brings that session's app to the front — the app, not the tab: only some terminals let anything outside them choose a tab, so the tooltip names the session instead.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Codenotch 会在代理结束工作或等待你回应时立即获知。用量环展开时点击可将会话所属应用切到前台；只有部分终端支持从外部切换标签页，因此详情提示会显示会话名称。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Codenotch reads usage from tools already signed in on this Mac — it never asks for your password. Install and sign in to any of Claude Code (the terminal tool, not the Claude app), Cursor (the editor or cursor-agent), Codex, Antigravity, GLM, Grok, OpenCode, GitHub Copilot or a Gemini API key (via Gemini CLI, OpenCode or Hermes), and its ring appears in the notch.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Codenotch 从这台 Mac 上已登录的工具读取用量，绝不会索要密码。安装并登录 Claude Code（终端工具，而非 Claude 应用）、Cursor（编辑器或 cursor-agent）、Codex、Antigravity、GLM、Grok、OpenCode、GitHub Copilot，或通过 Gemini CLI、OpenCode、Hermes 使用 Gemini API 密钥后，即可显示对应的用量环。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Codex is read live instead of from a log": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Codex 改为实时读取"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Codex reads live, and Always show stays on.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Codex 实时读取，始终显示保持开启。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Codex's live reading only recognised a 5-hour and a 7-day window. A free-plan account's real limit was a 30-day one, which fell through unnoticed and showed as nothing metered on an account that was genuinely tracked.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Codex 的实时读取此前只识别 5 小时和 7 天周期，遗漏免费套餐的 30 天限额。现在能正确显示该限额。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Completions": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "代码补全"
        }
      }
