  "Google account": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Google 账户"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Google will not answer Codenotch directly, so it asks Antigravity's own language server instead — the same place Antigravity's usage panel gets its figure.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Google 不允许 Codenotch 直接查询，因此改为通过 Antigravity 自身的语言服务器读取，与其用量面板使用相同数据源。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Grok is a new ring": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "新增 Grok 用量环"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Hide Sidebar": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "隐藏侧边栏"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Hover to inspect quota periods, request activity and statistics, with offline brand icons and explicit inactive periods.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "悬停查看配额周期、请求活动和统计数据，内置品牌图标，并明确标注未生效周期。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "In the Dock, in the menu bar, or nowhere at all.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "可显示在程序坞、菜单栏，或完全隐藏。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Independent refresh settings": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "独立刷新设置"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "It joins your Mac's own notch": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "与 Mac 自带刘海融合"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "It only ever watched the files the CLI and the VS Code extension write, so work done in the desktop app never made it spin.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "此前只监测 CLI 和 VS Code 扩展写入的文件，桌面应用中的工作不会触发旋转。现在也能识别桌面应用。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "It stopped being read but its last reading was kept, so the ring came back at the next launch.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "此前停止读取后仍保留旧读数，导致下次启动时用量环重新出现。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Its %@ limit is spent — resets %@": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "其 %@ 限额已耗尽，将于 %@ 重置"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Its %@ limit is spent.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "其 %@ 限额已耗尽。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Keep a work login apart with CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR? It now gets its own ring, its own limits, and its own row in Settings, beside your personal one.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "通过 CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR 区分工作账户？现在它拥有独立用量环、限额和设置条目，与个人账户并列显示。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Keep multiple accounts, manual credentials, query scripts, language settings and Code Switch R integration. Existing configurations can add Copilot and Gemini API from Add provider.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "保留多账户、手动凭据、查询脚本、语言设置和 Code Switch R 联动。已有配置可通过“添加供应商”加入 Copilot 和 Gemini API。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Keychain error (%d).": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "钥匙串错误（%d）。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Linked entries hide when Code Switch R stops and return when it reconnects. Disable integration in Settings at any time.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Code Switch R 停止时隐藏联动条目，重新连接后恢复。可随时在设置中关闭联动。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Live tray providers": {
