      }
    }
  },
  "Move between displays and restore the same position after relaunch. Disconnecting a display temporarily moves the notch to the main display.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "支持跨显示器移动，重启后恢复原位置。显示器断开时，用量环暂时移到主显示器。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Moves to the display containing the window receiving keyboard input.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "跟随当前接收键盘输入的窗口所在显示器。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Multiple Claude Code accounts": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "多个 Claude Code 账户"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Mute alerts": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "静音提醒"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "New Provider": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "新供应商"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "No Gemini CLI, OpenCode or Hermes sessions found": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "未找到 Gemini CLI、OpenCode 或 Hermes 会话"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "None": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "无"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Not connected": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "未连接"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Not selected": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "未选中"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Notch": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "用量环"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Nothing is connected, so the notch has no rings to draw.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "尚未连接任何供应商，因此没有可显示的用量环。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Nothing on screen. The readings stay in the menu bar menu when App icon is Menu bar. Otherwise, open Codenotch again from Applications to bring these settings back.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "屏幕上不显示用量环。应用图标设为菜单栏时，仍可从菜单查看读数；否则请从“应用程序”重新打开 Codenotch 返回设置。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Notifications": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "通知"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Nudge it clear of another menu-bar app anchored to the same spot; remembered per edge.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "沿当前边缘微调用量环，避开同一位置的其他菜单栏应用；每个边缘分别记忆位置。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "On the top edge it takes the hardware's shape, so the two read as one rather than as a bar parked underneath.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "位于顶部边缘时会采用硬件刘海的形状，使两者融为一体。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Once a token expired, every check went back to the keychain — a prompt a minute. It now reads the secret only when the owning app has changed it, and never retries a refusal on a timer.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "令牌过期后，此前每次检查都会访问钥匙串，可能每分钟弹出提示。现在仅在所属应用更新凭据后重新读取，拒绝授权后也不会定时重试。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "One momentary failure — the Mac waking from sleep, most often — used to lock the ring until the app restarted. It now clears itself on the next check.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "此前一次短暂失败（通常发生在 Mac 唤醒时）就可能卡住用量环，必须重启应用。现在下一次检查即可自动恢复。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Open the notch for a moment": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "短暂展开用量环"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "OpenCode's Go plan is a new ring": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "新增 OpenCode Go 套餐用量环"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Opening Settings could still read a switched-off provider's account, and a reply already in flight could restore a reading you had just asked it to forget.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "此前打开设置仍可能读取已关闭供应商的账户，进行中的请求也可能恢复刚刚清除的读数。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Pin the notch to one display, or show it on every one": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "固定到一台显示器，或在所有显示器上显示"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Pinned to %@.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "已固定到 %@。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Play %@": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "播放 %@"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Play a sound": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "播放声音"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Premium requests": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "高级请求"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Put the notch anywhere": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "自由放置用量环"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Put the notch where you need it, on any display.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "在任意显示器上，将用量环放到需要的位置。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Quotas, balances and daily usage": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "配额、余额与每日用量"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Read Cursor from cursor-agent, and enterprise plans correctly": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "通过 cursor-agent 读取 Cursor，正确支持企业套餐"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Reads GitHub's Copilot quota endpoint using the GitHub CLI session already on the Mac.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "使用这台 Mac 上已有的 GitHub CLI 登录状态读取 Copilot 配额接口。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Reads the Go plan's official usage endpoint with the key OpenCode itself stores on sign-in — no second sign-in.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "使用 OpenCode 登录时保存的密钥读取 Go 套餐官方用量接口，无需再次登录。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Refresh all": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "全部刷新"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Refresh indicators recover correctly": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "刷新指示器正确恢复"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Reset date": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "重置日期"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Reset time": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "重置时间"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Resets in %lld Day %lldh": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "%lld 天 %lld 小时后重置"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Resets in %lld Days %lldh": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "%lld 天 %lld 小时后重置"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Resets in %lldh %lldm": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "%lld 小时 %lld 分钟后重置"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Right, left, top or bottom. It keeps clear of the Dock and the menu bar, and follows when the Dock moves.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "支持左、右、上、下四个边缘，自动避开程序坞和菜单栏，并随程序坞位置调整。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Run `%@` once — it signs in and is what these readings come from. Use /login there to change account.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "先运行一次 `%@` 完成登录，用量将从该工具读取。可在其中使用 /login 切换账户。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Run `cursor-agent login` once — the notch reads that session. The Cursor editor works the same way, if you have it.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "先运行一次 `cursor-agent login`，用量环将读取该会话。已安装 Cursor 编辑器时，也可使用其登录状态。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Say when a session ends": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "会话结束时提醒"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Scoped": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "独立配置"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Selected": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "已选中"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Settings keeps your configured providers and accounts; drag a provider row by its handle to change the order the notch draws them in.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "设置保留已配置的供应商和账户；拖动供应商行的手柄，可调整用量环显示顺序。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Show Sidebar": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "显示侧边栏"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Sign in with GitHub CLI to read your Copilot usage": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "使用 GitHub CLI 登录以读取 Copilot 用量"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Sign in with GitHub CLI using `gh auth login`, then enable GitHub Copilot.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "使用 `gh auth login` 登录 GitHub CLI，然后启用 GitHub Copilot。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Signing out no longer leaves a spinner running. An older request cannot clear the indicator for a newer refresh.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "退出登录后不再持续显示加载动画，旧请求也不会清除新一轮刷新的指示状态。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Some limits are reached while the headline still shows room. The ring reads as spent and says when it lifts.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "部分限额可能在主要指标仍有余量时耗尽。用量环会显示已耗尽，并注明解除时间。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Stays until you have had a chance to look up.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "保持展开，留出抬头查看的时间。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Sub-1% usage no longer reads as 0%": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "低于 1% 的用量不再显示为 0%"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "SuperGrok's weekly Grok Build allowance, read from the same billing endpoint the CLI uses, with the session in ~/.grok/auth.json.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "使用 ~/.grok/auth.json 中的会话，从 CLI 使用的同一计费接口读取 SuperGrok 每周 Grok Build 额度。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Switch this on to give it a ring in the notch.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "启用后在用量环中显示此供应商。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Switching a provider off now really stops it": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "关闭供应商后真正停止读取"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Switching a provider off now sticks": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "关闭供应商后保持关闭"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Team on demand": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "团队按需用量"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "Terminal": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "终端"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "That display is disconnected. Codenotch follows the active window until it returns.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "该显示器已断开。恢复连接前，Codenotch 将跟随活跃窗口。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "The Codex ring notices the desktop app": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Codex 用量环支持桌面应用活动"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "The device accent by default, or a fixed colour for the ring's positive state — the amber and red warning colours stay fixed regardless.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "默认使用设备强调色，也可为正常用量状态指定颜色；琥珀色和红色警告颜色保持不变。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "The figure came from a file Codex writes during a turn, so it was as old as the last time you used it — three days stale in one case. Codenotch now asks Codex itself, and matches its own panel.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "此前读取 Codex 在对话中写入的文件，读数可能停留在上次使用时，甚至过期三天。现在直接查询 Codex，与其自身面板保持一致。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "The first release.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "首次发布。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "The in-app update history now includes the provider query features and these fixes.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "应用内更新历史现已包含供应商查询功能及相关修复。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "The list was capped at four whatever you were running on. It is now solved for the display: ten on a large one, and \"and N more\" only when there is genuinely no room for the rest.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "此前无论屏幕大小都最多显示四个会话。现在按屏幕空间决定数量，大屏可显示十个，仅在确实放不下时显示“还有 N 个”。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "The notch appears only on the display with the menu bar.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "用量环仅显示在带有菜单栏的显示器上。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "The notch draws these in this order. Drag one by its handle to move it.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "用量环按此顺序显示。拖动手柄可调整顺序。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "The notch opens itself for a few seconds and sounds a chime when an agent stops working or starts waiting on you; a click jumps to it.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "代理结束工作或等待你回应时，用量环会短暂展开并播放提示音；点击可跳转到对应应用。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "The ones that need you come first": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "优先显示需要你回应的会话"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "The sound plays on the ordinary output, not the interface sound-effects channel — so it is still heard with “Play user interface sound effects” switched off in System Settings → Sound.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "声音通过普通音频输出播放，不使用界面音效通道。因此即使在“系统设置 → 声音”中关闭“播放用户界面音效”，仍可听到提醒。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "There is nothing to sign in to: the count is added up from what Gemini CLI, OpenCode and Hermes recorded about their own calls. Your API key is never read.": {
    "extractionState": "manual",
    "localizations": {
      "zh-Hans": {
